        "original_id": "dd5e7b78-ad99-5e4f-bd90-80d810b89051",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Valeria Golino, Tom Cruise, Dustin Hoffman, Vincenzo Amato, Francesco Casisa, Bonnie Hunt\n- Films: Rain Man, Big Top Pee-wee, Hot Shots!, Respiro, Beethoven, Beethoven's 2nd, Jumanji, Jerry Maguire, The Green Mile, Cheaper by the Dozen, Cheaper by the Dozen 2\n- Characters: Charlie Babbitt, Raymond\n- Concepts: autistic savant, inheritance\n\nFacts:\n- Valeria Golino is best known to English-language audiences for her roles in Rain Man, Big Top Pee-wee, and Hot Shots!.\n- Rain Man tells the story of Charlie Babbitt, an abrasive and selfish young wheeler-dealer played by Tom Cruise, who learns that his estranged father has died.\n- In Rain Man, Charlie Babbitt discovers that his father left his multimillion-dollar estate to Raymond, Charlie's previously unknown brother.\n- In Rain Man, Raymond is an autistic savant played by Dustin Hoffman.\n- Respiro stars Valeria Golino, Vincenzo Amato, and Francesco Casisa.\n- Bonnie Hunt has appeared in Rain Man, Beethoven, Beethoven's 2nd, Jumanji, Jerry Maguire, The Green Mile, Cheaper by the Dozen, and Cheaper by the Dozen 2.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
